{
"content_id": "798163",
"reference_id": 21560,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "那鴻書 1:3",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "34001003",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<ul><li><p><span>不輕易發怒</span>：神對悖逆的忍耐與祂信實的慈愛息息相關（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02034006\" data-end-ref=\"02034006\">出34:6</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04014018\" data-end-ref=\"04014018\">民14:18</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19103008\" data-end-ref=\"19103008\">詩103:8</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29002013\" data-end-ref=\"29002013\">珥2:13</data>）。這特質曾令約拿失望，因他希望尼尼微立刻被毀（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32004002\" data-end-ref=\"32004002\">拿4:2</data>）。因為神是<span>忍耐的</span>神，所以祂有時會延遲執行罪人當受的刑罰（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16009029\" data-end-ref=\"16009030\">尼9:29–30</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45002004\" data-end-ref=\"45002004\">羅2:4</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61003009\" data-end-ref=\"61003009\">彼後3:9</data>）；但那些持續犯罪的人最終必面對神的審判（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02034007\" data-end-ref=\"02034007\">出34:7</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45014010\" data-end-ref=\"45014010\">羅14:10</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47005010\" data-end-ref=\"47005010\">林後5:10</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66014006\" data-end-ref=\"66014007\">啟14:6–7</data>）。</p></li><li><p><span>旋風和暴風</span>：這意象描述了神對惡人施行審判時的忿怒（另見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23029006\" data-end-ref=\"23029006\">賽29:6</data>）。</p></li></ul>",
