{
"content_id": "798170",
"reference_id": 21567,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "那鴻書 1:9",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "34001009",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>你們為何策劃（和合本譯為：<span>尼尼微人哪，設何謀攻擊）</span>：任何針對神的圖謀或計劃都不可能成功。若不符合神的計劃，人所籌算的都是徒然的（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19002001\" data-end-ref=\"19002012\">詩2篇</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23014026\" data-end-ref=\"23014027\">賽14:26–27</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23023009\" data-end-ref=\"23023009\">23:9</data>）。</p>",
"associations": {
