{
"content_id": "798155",
"reference_id": 21552,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "那鴻書 1:11",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "34001011",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>那邪惡謀士（和合本譯為：<span>有一人......圖謀邪惡</span>）就是亞述王。神也曾在希西家時代（約公元前701年；見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12019035\" data-end-ref=\"12019036\">王下19:35–36</data>）對付過那位亞述王的狂妄自大。亞述的<em>邪惡謀士</em>（<em>wicked counselor</em>）與即將來臨的彌賽亞形成對比，那君王是「奇妙策士（Wonderful Counselor）」（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23009006\" data-end-ref=\"23009006\">賽9:6</data>）。</p>",
"associations": {
"passage": [
{
"start_ref": "34001011",
"start_ref_usfm": "NAM 1:11",
"end_ref": "34001011",
"end_ref_usfm": "NAM 1:11"
}
],
"resource": [],
"acai": [
