{
"content_id": "798175",
"reference_id": 21572,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "那鴻書 2:2",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "34002002",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>葡萄樹象徵神賜福祂的子民（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23027002\" data-end-ref=\"23027006\">賽27:2–6</data>），而被<span>毀壞</span>的葡萄樹則反映出神先前對他們的管教（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23005001\" data-end-ref=\"23005007\">賽5:1–7</data>）。與大衛和所羅門王時代相比，以色列人如今境況淒涼，但神應許要恢復祂子民的<span>榮華</span>。</p>",
