{
"content_id": "798190",
"reference_id": 21587,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "那鴻書 3:4",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "34003004",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><span>那美貌的妓女多有淫行</span>：亞述以財富和安全、繁榮的承諾誘惑列國，卻以軍事武力和經濟剝削加害他們。因此，他們所受的懲罰，是對其所行之事理所當然的公義報應（見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20024012\" data-end-ref=\"20024012\">箴24:12</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29003004\" data-end-ref=\"29003008\">珥3:4–8</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66018006\" data-end-ref=\"66018006\">啟18:6</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66020012\" data-end-ref=\"66020012\">20:12</data>）。</p>",
