{
"content_id": "798191",
"reference_id": 21588,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "那鴻書 3:5",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "34003005",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>神兩次對尼尼微說：<span>我與你為敵</span>（另見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"34002013\" data-end-ref=\"34002013\">2:13</data>）。尼尼微所受的審判就像是歷史的警戒，提醒世人耶和華憎惡罪惡，並必照著人的行為報應個人和列國（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19009007\" data-end-ref=\"19009008\">詩9:7–8</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19062012\" data-end-ref=\"19062012\">62:12</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24046028\" data-end-ref=\"24046028\">耶46:28</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44017031\" data-end-ref=\"44017031\">徒17:31</data>）。有一天，神公義的審判必臨到全地一切悖逆祂的人（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017001\" data-end-ref=\"66019021\">啟17–19章</data>）。</p>",
"associations": {
"passage": [
{
